; claude: the media applications (CATALOG.md's Media section). Laid out
; like office/: the programs here, software/ for the golden frames, web/
; for the browser.
;
; So far TinyMediaPlayer, after Windows' Media Player and VLC: every
; kind of file the repository reads, sounds, tunes and pictures, each
; shown as what it is, and videos as graphics/videos/ comes
; (plan_video_teaching.md); and TinyWinamp, after Winamp 2: songs only,
; by their tags, through a ten-band equalizer. What it might contain
; next, each Tiny and after a famous original: an image viewer (ACDSee,
; IrfanView: a folder of pictures as thumbnails), a video editor (the
; cut, the fade, the frames on a timeline).

; what a file is and what it holds (Media), and media of our own to
; start from (Our_media): the player's machinery, apart from its screen,
; for the tests; and TinyWinamp's: an MP3's tags (Id3) and the ten-band
; equalizer (Graphic_eq)
(library
 (name media_player)
 (wrapped false)
 (modules Media Our_media Our_pictures Id3 Graphic_eq)
 (libraries
   audio audio_synthesis audio_wav audio_midi audio_abc audio_mod audio_mpeg
   graphics_rgba graphics_png graphics_gif graphics_jpeg graphics_xpm
   graphics_movie graphics_y4m graphics_fli graphics_avi graphics_mpeg1 graphics_mpeg_system
   graphics_core graphics_2d ; Our_media's clip, filmed by the 2D rasterizer
   music_voices ; Our_songs: the tracker's song
 ))

; claude: the pictures of our own the player shows, embedded as strings
; (scripts/build/files_to_string_ml.ml): the Image* examples' picture in
; its three formats, TinyMario's sprite, our clip as MPEG-1 (made
; once by ffmpeg, graphics/videos/tests/clips/make_clips.sh), and our
; bell and chirps as MP3 and MP2 (made once by LAME and twolame,
; audio/formats/tests/mpeg/make_mpeg.sh), and the clip with its sound
; as an .mpg (make_clips.sh again)
(rule
 (targets Our_pictures.ml)
 (deps
   %{project_root}/examples/demo_picture.png
   %{project_root}/examples/demo_picture.gif
   %{project_root}/examples/demo_picture.jpg
   %{project_root}/games/platform/mario_stand.xpm
   %{project_root}/libs/graphics/videos/tests/clips/ball_and_square.m1v
   %{project_root}/libs/audio/formats/tests/mpeg/stereo.mp3
   %{project_root}/libs/audio/formats/tests/mpeg/stereo.mp2
   %{project_root}/libs/graphics/videos/tests/clips/ball_and_square.mpg
   %{project_root}/scripts/build/files_to_string_ml.ml)
 (action
  (with-stdout-to
   %{targets}
   (run ocaml %{project_root}/scripts/build/files_to_string_ml.ml
     %{project_root}/examples/demo_picture.png %{project_root}/examples/demo_picture.gif
     %{project_root}/examples/demo_picture.jpg %{project_root}/games/platform/mario_stand.xpm
     %{project_root}/libs/graphics/videos/tests/clips/ball_and_square.m1v
     %{project_root}/libs/audio/formats/tests/mpeg/stereo.mp3
     %{project_root}/libs/audio/formats/tests/mpeg/stereo.mp2
     %{project_root}/libs/graphics/videos/tests/clips/ball_and_square.mpg))))

(executables
  (names TinyMediaPlayer TinyWinamp)
  (modules TinyMediaPlayer TinyWinamp)
  (libraries
    elm_core
    elm_playground
    music_voices
    media_player
    elm_playground_native ; implem of virtual elm_playground
  )
)
